Template: bfm-watcher/use-existing-config
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Use the settings of the earlier BFM watcher installation?
 This host still has the settings an earlier bfm-watcher installation left:
 ${found}
 .
 Keeping them leaves the watcher as it was (start it with: systemctl enable
 --now bfm-watcher). Otherwise they are moved to /etc/bfm/backup/ and the
 example settings are installed; bfm-watcher setup then starts from scratch.
 The watcher's state in /var/lib/bfm-watcher (secret.key included) is kept
 either way.
